# {{name}}

{{summary}} Built on [operonx](https://pypi.org/project/operonx/).

`src/{{feature}}/` is the feature: `ops.py` holds the logic, `graph.py` wires
it, `jobs.py` runs it over `data/`{{#http}}, `routes.py` serves it{{/http}}{{#chat}}, `prompts.py` is the
