```
{{/deploy}}

## Grow it

A new feature is a new folder under `src/` (`graph.py`, `ops.py`, `jobs.py`),
its tests in `tests/<feature>/`, and one more import in `app/main.py`.
`operonx init . --http` (or `--web`, `--deploy`) adds a part later. Read
`AGENTS.md` and `.operonx/guide/README.md` first.
